sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User (web app)
    participant API as Lambda API
    participant DB as Supabase (PostgreSQL)
    User->>API: PUT /api/voting/periods/:id/votes<br/>gk, def, cm, st player usernames
    API->>DB: Read voting window and candidate eligibility
    DB-->>API: Open period and eligible players
    API->>DB: Save the member's complete ballot atomically
    DB-->>API: Ballot committed
    API-->>User: Votes accepted
